      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Continuation of Office of Film, Theatre and Broadcasting. There is continued within the Office of the Mayor an Office of Film, Theatre and Broadcasting, to be headed by a commissioner who shall be appointed by and serve at the pleasure of the Mayor. The commissioner shall report to and be directly accountable to the Deputy Mayor for Finance and Economic Development.",
